                            <p>This attribution was accepted (with a query) in the second edition of
                                Medieval Libraries of Great Britain (1964). There were no relevant
                                changes in the Supplement (1987). The attribution appears to have
                                been inadvertently omitted during MLGB3 (2010-2015). The
                                corresponding index card records the following information:
                                    <q>Provenance inferred from contents. Published by Luard in
                                        <title>Annales Monastici</title> (Rolls Series), iv.</q> The
                                index card has the word <q>Reject</q> written in Neil Ker's
                                handwriting, but the attribution was never formally rejected in the
                                published handlists.</p></provenance>
